---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'; // CORREÇÃO: Importação obrigatória para otimização de imagens
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/Gemini_Generated_Image_lelaexlelaexlela.png';
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import FormattedDate from '../components/FormattedDate.astro'; 

import default_logo from '../../assets/default-logo.jpg'

const title = "About Market Ripple News";
const description = "Discover how global financial events create worldwide ripple effects. Explore the hidden connections between elite wealth, macro-finance, and Web3.";
const pubDate = new Date('June 27 2026');
const updatedDate = null;
const TitleSize = "2.5rem";

// Forma correta: passando o objeto importado para herdar dimensões reais
const heroImageData = { 
  width: 1600, 
  height: 900, 
  src: '../assets/Gemini_Generated_Image_lelaexlelaexlela.png', // Usando a variável importada, não a string de caminho
  alt: "community of investors" 
};

const heroImage = AboutHeroImage;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={title} description={description} image={default_logo} />
		<style>
	main {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 960px; /* Melhor prática para responsividade */
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	ul {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 2rem;
		list-style-type: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
	}
	/* CORREÇÃO 1: Definir tamanho fixo para os cards comuns ficarem lado a lado (2 por linha) */
	ul li {
		width: calc(50% - 1rem); /* 50% menos a metade do gap */
	}
	
	ul li * {
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: 0.2s ease;
	}

	/* CORREÇÃO 2: Primeiro item ocupa a linha toda e reseta alinhamentos */
	ul li:first-child {
		width: 100%;
		margin-bottom: 1rem; /* Margem controlada para separar da linha de baixo */
		text-align: left; /* Mudar para left ou manter center se quiser tudo centralizado */
	}

	/* CORREÇÃO 3: Forçar as imagens a se comportarem como bloco para matar o espaço fantasma */
	ul li img {
		display: block; 
		width: 100%; /* Garante que todas as imagens preencham seus respectivos li */
		height: auto;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
	}

	ul li:first-child img {
		width: 100%;
	}
	ul li:first-child .title {
		font-size: 2.369rem;
	}
	ul li a {
		display: block;
	}
	.title {
		margin: 0;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
		line-height: 1.2; /* Um pouco mais de respiro para títulos longos */
	}
	.date {
		margin: 0;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
	}
	ul li a:hover h4,
	ul li a:hover .date {
		color: rgb(var(--accent));
	}
	ul a:hover img {
		box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
	}

	/* Responsivo Mobile */
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		ul {
			gap: 1.5rem; /* Ajustado para melhor toque no mobile */
		}
		ul li {
			width: 100%; /* No mobile, todos viram lista vertical cheia */
			text-align: left;
		}
		ul li:first-child {
			margin-bottom: 0;
		}
		ul li:first-child .title {
			font-size: 1.563em;
		}
	}
</style>
	</head>
<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<article>
				<div class="hero-image">
					{heroImageData && <Image width={heroImageData.width} height={heroImageData.height} src={heroImage} alt={heroImageData.alt} loading="eager" />}
				</div>
        <div class="title">
            <br>
						<h1 style={{ fontSize: TitleSize, fontWeight: '700' }}>{title}</h1>
						<hr /><br>
					</div>

          Financial ecosystems don't move in a vacuum. A single regulatory shift, a sudden move by a crypto whale, or a strategic play by a billionaire tech mogul creates an immediate, global chain reaction. 

At <strong>Market Ripple News</strong>, we track these precise waves. We break down the hidden connections between elite wealth, traditional macro-finance, and the evolving Web3 economy, translating complex global events into digestible, high-impact stories.
<br><br>
<h2>Our Mission</h2>

We believe financial literacy shouldn't feel like reading a boring bank report. Our goal is to satisfy the curiosity of modern digital investors, entrepreneurs, and finance enthusiasts who want to look past the surface headlines. 

We dig deep into:
<ul>
  <li><strong>The Backstory of Billion-Dollar Fortunes:</strong> How elite wealth is built, managed, and shifted across industries.</li>
  <li><strong>Crypto & Macro Cascades:</strong> The real-world "ripple effects" that Bitcoin, digital assets, and regulations impose on everyday markets.</li>
  <li><strong>The Future of Money:</strong> Emerging economic trends, technological disruptors, and what they mean for your financial landscape.</li>
</ul>
<br><br>
<h2>Interactive Financial Insights</h2>

Market Ripple News is designed to be a living ecosystem, built on cutting-edge Jamstack performance to deliver insights directly to you without the clutter. Beyond analyzing trends, we focus on digital communities—creating a space where financial concepts are debated, insights are shared, and every reader can participate in the ongoing market conversation.
<br><br>
<h2>Editorial Integrity & Transparency</h2>

Content in the financial and crypto space falls under Google’s strictest <strong>Your Money or Your Life (YMYL)</strong> guidelines. We take this responsibility seriously. 

<ul>
  <li><strong>No Financial Advice:</strong> Market Ripple News is strictly an educational and informational platform. We provide deep-dive analytical context, historical insights, and economic curiosity pieces. We do not provide personalized financial, investment, or trading advice.</li>
  <li><strong>Information Gain:</strong> Every article published on our platform aims to provide unique commentary, data visualizations, or an angle not found on standard mainstream media outlets.</li>
  <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> Our research relies on public market data, blockchain analytics, and institutional financial reporting to ensure the highest analytical standards.</li>
</ul>
<hr style="margin-left: -1em" class = 'big-separator '>
<br><br><br>
<h3> Meet the Creator </h3>

<h2>Vitor Domingos</h2> <h1>Founder & Lead Tech Explorer</h1>
A <code>software developer and tech enthusiast</code> fascinated by the intersection of global economies, 
digital assets, and data analysis. Driven by a passion for uncovering the hidden patterns behind 
elite wealth and market shifts, they built Market Ripple News to translate complex global financial ripples 
into clear, high-impact stories for the modern internet user.

      </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
</body>
</html>